{
  "file": "evidence.json",
  "notes": [
    "the presenter signs the EvidenceStatement: the det-CBOR of the evidence reference without its signature field, statement_hex; signature in the reference is SHA-256 of the presenter's full tagged COSE_Sign1 bytes, cose_hex",
    "the presenter's COSE_Sign1 uses the Work record profile of P-102, protected header {1: alg, 3: \"application/work-record+cbor\", 4: kid}; the keys are those of cose-sign1.json",
